---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Wistia Alternative for Creators" seo={{ page_description: "Why creators are moving from Wistia to uVideoPlayer for hosting." }}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 prose">
    <h1>The Wistia Alternative Built for Creators</h1>
    <p class="lead">Wistia is incredible for B2B marketers who need deep CRM integrations. But if you're an independent creator, you're paying a premium for tools you'll never use.</p>

    <h2>Why creators seek Wistia alternatives</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cost:</strong> Wistia's pricing is designed for marketing budgets, not creator budgets.</li>
      <li><strong>Feature bloat:</strong> A/B testing and HubSpot integrations are overkill if you just want to sell a course.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>uVideoPlayer vs Wistia</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Feature</th>
          <th>uVideoPlayer</th>
          <th>Wistia</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Unbranded Player</td>
          <td>Yes</td>
          <td>Yes (Pro tier +)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>CRM Integrations</td>
          <td>No (We keep it simple)</td>
          <td>Extensive (HubSpot, Marketo)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Pricing</td>
          <td>Pay-as-you-go ($5/mo base)</td>
          <td>Starts at $19/mo (strict limits)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Best for</td>
          <td>Course creators, bloggers</td>
          <td>B2B Marketing teams</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="mt-12 bg-[var(--color-bg-base)] p-8 rounded border border-[var(--color-border)] not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Start saving today</h3>
      <p class="mb-6 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Get the same clean look for a fraction of the price.</p>
      <a href="/pricing/" class="inline-block rounded bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-5 py-3 font-medium text-white hover:bg-[var(--color-primary-dark)]">View Pricing</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
